WEBVTT

00:02:29.863 --> 00:02:33.097
And I hate being bad at stuff.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.297
I am a go-big-or-go-home kind of a gal.

00:02:36.897 --> 00:02:38.297
I like being good at things,

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:40.330
and I quit exercising

00:02:40.363 --> 00:02:43.763
because I wasn't willing to be bad at it.

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:46.697
Here's why we need
to be willing to be bad:

00:02:47.363 --> 00:02:52.130
being good requires
that our effort and our motivation

00:02:52.163 --> 00:02:55.030
be in proportion to each other.

00:02:55.597 --> 00:02:57.930
The harder something is for us to do,

00:02:57.963 --> 00:03:02.030
the more motivation we need
to do that thing.